    "People who moved their worrying to a short daily worry period spent less time worrying and reported less anxiety and fewer sleep problems." : {
      "comment" : "Research study showing that people who moved their worrying to a short daily worry period spent less time worrying and reported less anxiety and fewer sleep problems.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lidé, kteří přesunuli své starosti do krátkého denního úseku, strávili starostmi méně času a uváděli méně úzkosti a méně problémů se spánkem."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Menschen, die ihr Grübeln auf eine kurze tägliche Sorgenzeit verlegten, sorgten sich weniger lange und berichteten von weniger Angst und weniger Schlafproblemen."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "People who moved their worrying to a short daily worry period spent less time worrying and reported less anxiety and fewer sleep problems."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quienes trasladaron sus preocupaciones a un breve momento diario dedicaron menos tiempo a preocuparse y refirieron menos ansiedad y menos problemas de sueño."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les personnes qui ont déplacé leurs soucis vers une courte période quotidienne y ont passé moins de temps et ont signalé moins d’anxiété et moins de troubles du sommeil."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chi ha spostato le preoccupazioni in un breve momento quotidiano ha dedicato meno tempo a preoccuparsi e ha riferito meno ansia e meno problemi di sonno."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配する時間を毎日の短い時間に移した人は、心配に費やす時間が減り、不安や睡眠の問題も軽くなったと報告しています。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정을 매일 짧은 걱정 시간으로 옮긴 사람들은 걱정하는 시간이 줄고, 불안과 수면 문제도 덜 겪었다고 보고했어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pessoas que passaram suas preocupações para um breve período diário gastaram menos tempo se preocupando e relataram menos ansiedade e menos problemas de sono."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Люди, которые перенесли тревожные мысли на короткое ежедневное время, меньше тратили сил на тревогу и сообщали о меньшей тревожности и меньших проблемах со сном."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "คนที่ย้ายการกังวลไปไว้ในช่วงเวลาสั้น ๆ ประจำวัน ใช้เวลากังวลน้อยลง และรายงานว่ากังวลและมีปัญหาการนอนน้อยลง"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Những người chuyển việc lo lắng sang một khoảng ngắn mỗi ngày đã dành ít thời gian lo hơn và cho biết họ bớt lo âu cũng như ít gặp vấn đề về giấc ngủ hơn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把烦恼挪到每天固定的一小段时间里，人们花在烦恼上的时间更少，焦虑和睡眠问题也有所减轻。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把煩惱挪到每天固定的一小段時間裡，人們花在煩惱上的時間更少，焦慮和睡眠問題也有所減輕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick your Worry Time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vyber svůj Čas na starosti"
