    "You postponed a worry and came back to it on purpose. That's the whole technique." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Odložil(a) jsi starost a záměrně ses k ní vrátil(a). To je celá technika."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast eine Sorge aufgeschoben und bist bewusst zu ihr zurückgekehrt. Das ist die ganze Technik."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You postponed a worry and came back to it on purpose. That's the whole technique."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pospusiste una preocupación y volviste a ella a propósito. Esa es toda la técnica."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu as reporté un souci et tu y es revenu exprès. C’est toute la technique."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hai rimandato una preoccupazione e ci sei tornato di proposito. Questa è l’intera tecnica."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "心配を先延ばしにして、決めた時間にあえて向き合いました。これがこの方法のすべてです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정을 미뤄 두었다가 정해 둔 때에 다시 마주했어요. 이게 이 기법의 전부예요."
